<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept importance="optional" id="t00218">
	<title>Forward and backward adjustment</title>
	<shortdesc/>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01002">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e01003">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25B022.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_print" id="e01004">
			<title>Operation</title>
			<ul id="e01005">
				<li>
					<p>The headrest may be adjusted forward to 3 different positions by pulling the headrest forward to the desired detent.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>To adjust the headrest to it’s furthest rearwards position, pull it fully forward to the farthest position and release it.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>